Usage: agent-deck session fork <id|title> [options]

Fork a Claude, OpenCode, Pi, Codex, or Oh My Pi session with conversation context.

Options:

Examples:
  agent-deck session fork my-project
  agent-deck session fork my-project -t "my-fork"
  agent-deck session fork my-project -t "my-fork" -g "experiments"
  agent-deck session fork my-project -w fork/experiment
  agent-deck session fork my-project -w fork/new-idea -b
  agent-deck session fork my-project -w fork/wip -b --with-state
  agent-deck session fork my-project -w fork/wip -b --with-state-and-gitignored
